---
import Eyebrow from '../ui/Eyebrow.astro';
---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-paper relative border-b border-borderMuted">
  <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Visual Geometry -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative aspect-square border border-borderMuted p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-surface shadow-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
            <span class="font-bold text-ink">SPEC: ARCHITECTURAL</span>
            <span>TOLERANCE: ±1.5mm</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 my-auto">
            <span class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl uppercase font-bold text-gold block leading-none">
              ZERO SHORTCUTS.
            </span>
            <p class="font-body text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              We insist on virgin 6063-T6 architectural grade aluminium, certified safety toughened glass, and European hardware rated for multi-decade duty cycles.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-borderMuted flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink font-mono font-semibold">
            <span>PUNE MONSOON TESTED</span>
            <span>AIR &amp; WATER TIGHT</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Craft Tenets -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <Eyebrow text="ENGINEERING & CRAFT" />
          <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl uppercase tracking-tight font-bold text-ink leading-[1.05]">
            How we protect your architectural intent.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gold font-bold">01 / SURVEY</span>
            <h4 class="font-display text-xl uppercase font-bold text-ink">Digital Laser Measurement</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Every opening is scanned with precision laser levels before fabrication to eliminate gaps, uneven sightlines, and on-site retrofitting compromises.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gold font-bold">02 / MATERIALS</span>
            <h4 class="font-display text-xl uppercase font-bold text-ink">Certified Alloy &amp; Glass</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              We never use scrap or re-melted extrusions. Profiles maintain uniform wall thickness and finishes resist fading under harsh UV exposure.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gold font-bold">03 / HARDWARE</span>
            <h4 class="font-display text-xl uppercase font-bold text-ink">Industrial-Duty Bearings</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Heavy sliding panels require heavy-duty quad rollers and concealed locking gear that operate effortlessly even after years of continuous daily use.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2.5">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gold font-bold">04 / INSTALLATION</span>
            <h4 class="font-display text-xl uppercase font-bold text-ink">Site Coordination</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              We coordinate directly with your architect, civil contractor, and false ceiling teams so thresholds, lintels, and reveals match the drawings.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
